---
import Container from '../Container.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone font-medium">
          Stefano Andrello
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-midnight">
          AI Strategist per PMI italiane.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 text-xl text-stone leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Formazione conforme EU AI Act, consulenza strategica, sviluppo di agenti AI e MCP server. Aiuto le aziende italiane a integrare l&apos;intelligenza artificiale con metodo, non con annunci.
        </p>

        <ul class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <li class="border border-gold rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal">
            Strategist
          </li>
          <li class="border border-gold rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal">
            AI Agentica &amp; MCP
          </li>
          <li class="border border-gold rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal">
            Speaker
          </li>
          <li class="border border-gold rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-charcoal">
            Autore (2 libri)
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href="#percorso"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-gold text-midnight rounded-full px-8 py-3 font-medium hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-gold/90 transition-all"
          >
            Vedi il percorso AI Ratio &rarr;
          </a>
          <a
            href="#calcolatore"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-midnight text-midnight rounded-full px-8 py-3 font-medium hover:bg-midnight hover:text-cream transition-colors"
          >
            Calcola quanto ti costa oggi
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <img
          src="/img/stefano.png"
          alt="Stefano Andrello, AI Strategist per PMI italiane"
          width="720"
          height="720"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="aspect-square object-cover rounded-lg shadow-xl max-w-[360px] w-full mx-auto"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
